{"id":"G5083","lemma":"τηρέω","transliteration":"tēreō","sayIt":"tēreō","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to keep: observe","meaning":"τηρέω, -ῶ\n[in LXX for שָׁמַר, נָצַר, etc. ;]\n1. to watch over, guard, keep, preserve: Mat.27:36, Act.16:23, al.; ἑαυτόν, 2Co.11:9, 1Ti.5:22, Jas.1:27, Ju 21; before εἰς, Jhn.12:7, Act.25:21, 1Pe.1:4, 2Pe.2:4 2:9 3:7, Ju 6; ἐν, Jhn.17:11-12, Ju 21; ἐκ, Jhn.17:15, Rev.3:10; τ. πίστιν, 2Ti.4:7, Rev.14:12; τ. ἑνότητα τ. πνεύματος, Eph.4:3.\n2. to watch, give heed to, observe: τ. σάββατον, Jhn.9:16; τ. ἐντολήν (-άς), Mat.19:17, Jhn.14:15 15:10, 1Ti.6:14, 1Jn.2:3-4 Jn 3:22 Jn 3:24 Jn 5:3, Rev.12:17 14:12; τ. λόγον (-ους), Jhn.8:51-52, 55 14:23-24 15:20 17:6, 1Jn.2:5, Rev.3:8, 10 22:7, 9; τ. νόμον, Act.15:5, Jas.2:10; τ. παράδοσιν, Mrk.7:9; τ. ἔργα, Rev.2:26; τ. γεγραμμένα, Rev.1:3 (cf. δια-, παρα-, συν-τηρέω)\nSYN.: φυλάσσω, implying custody and protection: τ. expresses the idea of watchful care and \"may mark the result of which φ. is the means\" (Thayer see word) (AS)","glosses":["keep","keeps","kept","have kept","does not keep","obey"],"count":64,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-19","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"keep","kjv":"keep"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"observe","kjv":"observe"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"they kept watch over","kjv":"they watched"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":54,"renderings":{"bsb":"who were guarding","kjv":"watching"}},{"chapterId":"mat-28","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"guards","kjv":"the keepers"}},{"chapterId":"mat-28","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"to obey","kjv":"to observe"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-2","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"have saved","kjv":"hast kept"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-8","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"keeps","kjv":"keep"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-8","v":52,"renderings":{"bsb":"keeps","kjv":"keep"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-8","v":55,"renderings":{"bsb":"I keep","kjv":"keep"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-9","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"He does not keep","kjv":"he keepeth"}},{"